## Why This Is Asked

This question evaluates practical Azure data pipeline design with beginner-friendly constraints, testing real-world implementation of data isolation, infrastructure as code, and CI/CD practices.

## Key Concepts

- Event Hubs for scalable event ingestion
- Per-tenant data isolation through Azure SQL schemas
- PII filtering and transformation with Azure Functions
- Infrastructure as Code using Bicep
- Continuous integration/deployment with GitHub Actions
- Cross-region disaster recovery via SQL Geo-Replication and RA-GRS
- Cost optimization: autoscaling, partition configuration, retention policies

## Code Example

